---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Training Data for Speculative Decoding Drafters: Theory, Practice, and Code | Catpuccino.ai"
  description="A practical guide to building training corpora for speculative decoding draft models — covering the KL-divergence theory behind acceptance rates, target-model response regeneration, domain balance, and DFlash's anchor sampling augmentation."
  crumb="Spec-Decoding Data Prep"
>

